WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:03,450
Water-based knife sharpening saves even sharpening water

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:06,850
Boss, my artistic skills seem to be getting better again

3
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:10,050
If you don't kill two more funerals, you'll be better at it.

4
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:14,570
The atmosphere is far from good

5
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:21,250
I've already cleaned up this area around here.

6
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:24,450
If you want to upgrade, you have to go to a crowded place.

7
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:37,520
In such a big place, there is not even a trace of a living person.

8
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,920
That means it's all over the inside.

9
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:43,500
Stop talking nonsense. Kill the ones who are easy to kill first.

10
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:47,100
It took ten days to fix the base, and the dog’s protective clothing was also matched.

11
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:49,100
All that's missing is this drone
